1
00:00:00,230 --> 00:00:02,420
ZAMIN FK da katta o‘zgarishlar!

2
00:00:02,420 --> 00:00:06,164
Endi bizda nafaqat klub, balki haqiqiy jamoa ham bor!

3
00:00:06,384 --> 00:00:10,206
Yoshlar akademiyamizning birinchi menejeri ham aniqlandi!

4
00:00:10,206 --> 00:00:12,083
@yusup_maxamadov, tabriklaymiz!

5
00:00:12,303 --> 00:00:15,521
Mana ular — ZAMIN FK ning haqiqiy tarkibi!

6
00:00:17,341 --> 00:00:19,357
Va zaxiradagi o‘yinchilarimiz!

7
00:00:23,777 --> 00:00:25,119
Bu hali boshlanishi!

8
00:00:25,119 --> 00:00:27,535
ZAMIN FK endi birgalikda qurilmoqda.

9
00:00:27,535 --> 00:00:30,756
Siz ham bizning tariximizning bir qismi bo‘ling!

10
00:00:30,976 --> 00:00:32,996
Siz qaysi pozitsiyada o‘ynaysiz?

11
00:00:32,996 --> 00:00:33,880
Izohga yozing!

